<body><main class="invoice"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start border-bottom pb-4"><div><div class="invoice-logo">AchatHub</div><span>Tout acheter, au meilleur prix.</span></div><div class="text-end"><h1 class="h3">Facture</h1><strong>{{ $order->number }}</strong><br><span>{{ $order->created_at->format('d/m/Y') }}</span></div></div><div class="row g-4 my-3"><div class="col-md-6"><h2 class="h6 text-uppercase">Facturé à</h2><p>{{ $order->shipping_name }}<br>{{ $order->shipping_address }}<br>{{ $order->shipping_postal_code }} {{ $order->shipping_city }}</p></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="invoice-meta"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span>Paiement</span><strong>{{ $order->payment_status }}</strong></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span>Commande</span><strong>{{ $order->status }}</strong></div></div></div></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Article</th><th>Qté</th><th class="text-end">Prix unitaire</th><th class="text-end">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($order->items as $item)<tr><td>{{ $item->name }}<small class="d-block text-secondary">{{ $item->sku }}</small></td><td>{{ $item->quantity }}</td><td class="text-end">{{ number_format($item->price, 2, ',', ' ') }} €</td><td class="text-end">{{ number_format($item->price * $item->quantity, 2, ',', ' ') }} €</td></tr>@endforeach</tbody></table><div class="ms-auto" style="max-width:330px"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-1"><span>Sous-total</span><strong>{{ number_format($order->subtotal, 2, ',', ' ') }} €</strong></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-1"><span>Livraison</span><strong>{{ number_format($order->shipping, 2, ',', ' ') }} €</strong></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-top mt-2 pt-3 fs-5"><strong>Total TTC</strong><strong>{{ number_format($order->total, 2, ',', ' ') }} €</strong></div></div><p class="text-secondary small mt-5">Document généré depuis votre espace AchatHub. Conservez-le avec votre numéro de commande.</p></main><button class="btn btn-dark invoice-actions" onclick="window.print()">Imprimer ou enregistrer en PDF</button></body></html>
